control "CouponController" as CouponController
participant "CouponService" as CouponService
database "MySQL" as DB_MySQL
participant "Guard" as Guard
participant "SealService" as SealService
participant "FlairService" as FlairService
== sim, resgatar: emite o cupom Fashion AI da marca/celebridade ==
